stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Active: Admin: POST /api/v1/platforms\n(platform created, immediately active)

    Active --> Active: Platform: POST /v1/identifiers/{datasetId}\n(registers/updates identifiers)

    Active --> Deleted: Admin: DELETE /api/v1/platforms/{id}\n(platform removed from registry)

    Deleted --> [*]: Platform entry removed\nAssociated users lose access\nExisting consignments remain in DB

    note right of Active
        State: Active
        - Platform can register identifiers
        - platformRegistry[id] returns Platform object
        - Platform users can authenticate
        - Dataset requests routed to platform.baseUrl
        - supportsSubsetting: determines if gate uses full XML or subset API
    end note

    note right of Deleted
        State: Deleted
        - Platform removed from in-memory registry
        - Existing consignments NOT deleted (data retention)
        - Platform users get 401 (platformRegistry lookup fails)
        - Dataset requests to this platform will fail
    end note
